{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"id":"BandicamCompany.Bandicam","latestVersion":"27.0.7.2687","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"Bandicam is a lightweight screen recorder software for Windows that can capture anything on your PC screen as a high-quality video.","license":"Shareware","licenseUrl":"https://www.bandicam.com/company/tos/","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"Bandicam is a lightweight screen recorder software for Windows that can capture anything on your PC screen as a high-quality video.","license":"Shareware","licenseUrl":"https://www.bandicam.com/company/tos/","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Bandicam is a lightweight screen recorder software for Windows that can capture anything on your PC screen as a high-quality video.\nThis app also makes it possible to record a certain area on a PC screen, or capture a game that uses the DirectX/OpenGL/Vulkan graphics technologies.\nBandicam will help you carry out a screen capture with high compression ratio, while preserving the video quality of the original work, and provide performance far superior to other screen capture software that provides similar functions.","moniker":"bandicam","name":"Bandicam","packageUrl":"https://www.bandicam.com/","publisher":"Bandicam","publisherUrl":"https://www.bandicam.com/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://www.bandicam.com/downloads/version_history/","tags":["capture","screen-capture","video","video-recording"]}},"longDescription":"Bandicam is a lightweight screen recorder software for Windows that can capture anything on your PC screen as a high-quality video.\nThis app also makes it possible to record a certain area on a PC screen, or capture a game that uses the DirectX/OpenGL/Vulkan graphics technologies.\nBandicam will help you carry out a screen capture with high compression ratio, while preserving the video quality of the original work, and provide performance far superior to other screen capture software that provides simi